<title>FRANCE: Cie des Signaux buys Ritzenthaler.</title>
<headline>Cie des Signaux buys Ritzenthaler.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compagnie des Signaux said on Tuesday it had bought Ritzenthaler/Haffner Technologies, specialising in security systems but gave no purchase price.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the acquisition was part of a strategy of external growth. It follows its deal last month to acquire Philips Datacommunications. Last March, it bought Matra Securite.</p>
<p>Ritzenthaler had annual turnover of around 230 million francs in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
